  subsetVariables: array, station, wmo_platform_code, longitude, latitude, depth.
  Longitude-Konvention: degrees_east 0..360 (170W=190, 120W=240).
  Stichprobe gemessen (0n155w, array="TAO/TRITON"):
      pmelTao5dayW.csv?time,latitude,longitude,WS_401,WD_410&time>=2026-05-01
