        -> 2026-05-01  WS_401=3.85 m/s WD_410=270.5; 2026-05-16 WS_401=3.96 ...
      pmelTao5daySst.csv?time,latitude,longitude,T_25&... (gleiche Filter)
        -> 2026-05-01 T_25=28.36 C ... 2026-05-16 T_25=28.83 C
